Forked content
--------------

The file patterns.ts in this directory is a faithful TypeScript port of the
upstream patterns.py at the commit above. The pattern data — 25 regex/
substring rules covering unsafe deserialization, command injection, XSS
sinks, crypto footguns, XXE, GitHub Actions injection, and TLS-verification
disablement — is unmodified in substance.

